window.products.push({"id":557110,"name":"Sivio Satin Pillowcase for Hair and Skin, 2-Pack, Queen/Standard Size (20 x 30 inches), Slip Pillow Cases, Soft Satin Pillow Cover with Envelope Closu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ML5iTr2hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"2-pack (Insert Not Included), Wrinkle-free & Fade Resistant Satin, Machine Washable, 20 X 30 Inches, 3 Colors Available Imported Better Than Cotton: Silky textured satin won't absorb moisture, thus easily retains luster and suppleness of your skin and hair, improving sleep quality. Sivio premium polyester satin pillowcase is soft and smooth to the touch, more resilient and durable than mulberry pillowcase. Youthful Skin Recipe: Non-absorbent, Sivio ultra-smooth satin helps preserve moisture in the skin and reduces frictions against your face so that your skin is pumped-up, wrinkle- and line-free. The silky texture also helps you stay cool at night and makes you less prone to sweating while enjoying a whole night of beauty sleep. Bouncy Hair Mystery: With minimized frictions, silky satin reduces hair breakages without absorbing moisture, so you are less likely to wake up with frizz and tangles. In the long term, the benefits on your lavish curls and beautiful eyelashes will be spectacular. Thoughtful Design: Sivio satin pillowcase comes with a neat envelop closure to keep the insert from sliding out of the case. Slip design makes putting on and off the pillowcase more handy and free from metal scrapes from a zipper. The pillowcase features meticulous two needle sewing and neat stitching so it stay new and in shape for years to come. Comes with Warranty: 2-pack pillowcases in 20 x 30 inches fit most standard and queen pillows. Sivio satin pillowcases are easy to care for, stain and fade resistant, and wrinkle free, no ironing necessary. We guarantee your 100% satisfaction. If within 30 days you are not satisfied with your satin pillowcase, just return it for a full refund! No questions asked, no hassle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ML5iTr2hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sivio","source_asin":"B09P1CGY7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P1CGY7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P1CGY7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
