window.products.push({"id":557127,"name":"Jay Franco Disney Pixar Coco Power of Music Kids Room Rug - Large Area Rug Measures 4 x 5 Feet - Features Miguel & Dante (Offical Disney Pixar Product","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LfDyAfMFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER SOFT & FUN DESIGN – Kids room rug measures 4 x 5 feet (52 x 69 inches). This large area rug is made from 100% polymide and is enhanced with a latex backing to prevent slipping and for added safety. Soft fabric allows for ultimate play time and is comfortable to touch. HIGH QUALITY & EASY CARE – Each room rug is made from durable cut loop nylon for long lasting use. Printed design is fade resistant for continuous beauty. Easy care, spot clean only and safe to vacuum. GREAT GIFT – Bring home your favorite characters with this Coco room rug. Great for the bedroom, living room, or playroom, your child will love playing on this beautifully designed area rug featuring, Miguel and Dante. SHOP THE COCO COLLECTION - Complete your bedroom with our other Disney Pixar Coco products - Coordinating bedding and accessories available (sold separately). OUR FAMILY COMPANY - Our company is still small and family run. We take great pride in our products and our unsurpassed customer service. We know that our wonderful customers are the reason we are in business! We offer excellent quality, non-toxic products. With our coordinating Disney Coco accessories, you can mix and match our high-quality and unique boy’s comforter sets, girl’s comforter sets, kids sheet sets, or kids pillows.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LfDyAfMFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jay Franco","source_asin":"B086M6CMSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086M6CMSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086M6CMSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":557128,"name":"ZZIKO Bathroom Rugs Mat, Black and White Non Slip Bath Mat Geometric Triangle Fluffy Microfiber Absorbent Washable Bath Rug Runner for Bathroom 20\"x 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713d5AQ2niS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★Fluffy Microfiber Bath Rugs: This black bath mat is made of premium thick Microfiber, very soft to touch, that brings you a more comfortable feeling, protects your feet from the cold floor. This soft bathroom shower rugs measures about 16\"x24\"(40x60cm). Unique design and classic color provides a fashionable accent to any area within the home. ★Non-skid Rubber Backing and No Shedding: The bathroom rug non-slip bottom is made of durable TPR material, this non-slip backing has strong Adhesion can help keep bathroom rugs in place on your floors and protect your family's safety. The super-fiber material on the surface adopts premium Fiber Locking Technology, every fiber is firmly attached onto the backing free of fiber-shedding issue. ★Super Water Absorbent : Microfiber rug absorbs water and dries quickly. The bathroom mats help to quickly absorb the moisture from wet feet and locks the moisture in the carpet to keep your feet dry, and the quick-dry fibers keep this rug looking and feeling great, even with repeated use. ★Machine Washable Bathroom Mat: Bathroom mat is easy to clean, hand washed or machine washed is fine. Simply throw the washable bath rugs into your washing machine in gentle detergent with gentle cycle and let it air dry naturally. Color will not fade and will stay vibrant for many years no matter how many times you wash and dry! ★Multiple Purpose: Fluffy microfiber geometric bath rugs are widely used in the bedroom, bathroom, living room, entryways, laundry, hotels, feet-spa club, and by bathtub and sink. Colorful and unique design make it perfect decoration for any room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713d5AQ2niS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZZIKO","source_asin":"B09HT6Z4CJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HT6Z4CJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HT6Z4CJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":557129,"name":"Citrine Wine Bottle String Lights with Cork 6.6ft 20 LED Silver Wire, Mini Decorative Crystal Raw Stone Fairy Lights for Liquor Bottles Crafts Party, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vTKoXCr0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique Wine Bottle Decorative Lights】With the combination of natural Citrine and wine bottle lights, our creative crystal string lights are suitable for most beer, soda, wine and other types of glass bottles or jars. It can also be widely used to decorate rooms, trees, and patios, bringing a special ambiance to your home. 【Natural Citrine String Lights】20 natural Citrines are unique decorations that shine under the warm white light for a breathtaking effect. Citrine has been hand washed/dried/hand glued, is non-corrosive, non-toxic and safe for babies, children and pets. Waterproof string lights keep glowing even when placed in water to create an enchanting atmosphere. 【Upgraded Cork & Battery】We are more stringent in design and material selection of our cork, the high-quality cork and springs with higher stiffness coefficients make the battery less likely to move so that there are no more problems such as poor contact. Light is powered by 3 LR44 button cell batteries, low voltage, low energy consumption; insulated silver copper wire makes it safe to touch and safe for children and pets. Note that when the light becomes dim, the batteries need to be replaced. 【Mood Regulation & Dreamy Atmosphere】Natural crystal with warm white light makes the original light more soft and dreamy, and the special attributes of Citrine can regulate our mood and help meditation. It is a unique home decoration that can create a harmonious, romantic and warm atmosphere, ideal for birthday parties, weddings, Valentine's Day, Christmas and other romantic holidays. 【Package Includes】2 strings of 6.6 feet wine bottle lights with about 0.6-0.9 inch diameter cork, and 20 Citrine lights of about 0.4\"-0.6\" diameter per string (the size of each stone varies, spacing 3.94\") . In addition to the batteries that come with the strings, extra 6 batteries are included to ensure the experience. Simply unplug the insulating piece before using, then turn on the switch and the string lights will shine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vTKoXCr0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tronsboo","source_asin":"B0BGH8QL2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGH8QL2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGH8QL2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":557130,"name":"Vivaterra OBJET Bubble Recycled Glass Balloon Vase, 734-Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kxora7FiL._AC_SL1126_.jpg","description":"Perfectly imperfect, our collection of 100% recycled glass balloon vases is a harmonious blend of whimsy and elegance. These stately vases are sure to make themselves known in any space with their dramatic shapes, and make an even bolder statement when filled with flowers or greenery. The nature of the recycled materials and artistically blown shapes ensure that each vase is an original. The 7-inch bubble vase features an over all stout, organic shape and a lipped opening, perfect for displaying a few small blossoms. Available in a variety of color options, show off a single vase in your favorite color or mix and match the bubble with other vases in our collection to create a show-stopping centerpiece. Made in Spain. Recycling glass saves energy. Making new glass means heating sand and other substances to 2,600 degrees. That requires a lot of energy and creates a lot of industrial pollution. One of the steps in glass recycling is to crush the glass and create a product called \"cullet.\" Making recycled glass products from cullet consumes 40% less energy than making new glass from raw materials, because cullet melts at a much lower temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kxora7FiL._AC_SL1126_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vivaterra","source_asin":"B0BV7CJRMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV7CJRMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV7CJRMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
