window.products.push({"id":557183,"name":"DDCDQ-Stainless Steel Multifunctional Egg Slicer For Hard Boiled Eggs Mushroom Slicer Dishwasher Soft Food Slicer Boiled Egg Ham Slicers Stainless Ste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eFXSJ22lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Premium Quality】Egg slicer of cutting wires is made of high quality 304 stainless steel what can be used in contact with food, healthy and harmless. And quality cast aluminum for its base and handle, bright and smooth surface. Besides it is anti-rust, safe to use and dishwasher safe. 【Easy to Use】Our stainless steel wires have a very good performance. Not Only slicing hard-boiled eggs but perfect for other soft food or fruit such as Dragon Fruit, Butter as well. 【Unique and Exquisite Design】Features two slicing disks to create picture perfect round or oval slices as well as wedges. 【Safety and Easy Clean】It is a dishwasher safe stainless steel hard-boiled eggs slicer for quick and easy clean up. 【Easy to Store】Thanks to its compact size and lightweight plastic material, perfect for creating chef's salads or egg-based appetizers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eFXSJ22lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DDCDQ","source_asin":"B08XQJBDG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XQJBDG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XQJBDG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":557184,"name":"Lamson Rosewood Forged 5-inch Kullenschliff Santoku Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51A0h3-jRbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Lamson cutlery, kitchen tools and trade tools are still handcrafted in Massachusetts by American workers. We are proud to say that after 179 years, Lamson still produces the finest cutlery, kitchen tools and trade tools made in America that aim at nothing short of perfection. Lamson was established in Shelburne Falls, Massachusetts in 1837. As one of the oldest cutlery manufacturers in the United States, Lamson has been the choice of home and professional cooks as well as US Presidents for the last 179 years because of its high standard of craftsmanship. These traditions are true today not only in our cutlery and kitchen tools but in our barbeque equipment, TreeSpirit (Handcrafted North American Hardwood Kitchen Utensils and Wood Care Products) and HotSpot ( Professional Grade Silicone Potholders, Trivets, HotHandles) products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51A0h3-jRbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lamson","source_asin":"B000JIR3VC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000JIR3VC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000JIR3VC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":557185,"name":"Cast Iron Skillet Set - 4-Piece Chef Pan - 6\" + 8\" + 10\" + 12\"-Inch + 4 Heat-Resistant Handle Holder Grips - Pre-seasoned Oven Safe Cookware - Indoor/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813NjdG4KgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRECISION HEAT DISTRIBUTION and UNRIVALED HEAT RETENTION – Cuisinel cast iron is famous for that perfect, succulent sear, without losing any heat when cold food hits the pan. Whether you're using our premium cookware on your kitchen stove, oven, BBQ or even an inconsistent campfire, the lossless heat retention and consistent heat distribution makes managing your cooking times effortless. Can be used for frying, baking, grilling, broiling, braising and sautéing meats, vegetables and more! ERGONOMIC ASSIST HANDLE DESIGN and POUR SPOUTS – The 10\" and 12\" skillets include handle helper loops, making you able to use both hands for a more confident grip. These robust, rugged and versatile cooking utensils can be used for casseroles, braising, baking: cakes, pies, baked mac n' cheese, along with cooking and frying all favorite classics: steaks, burgers, eggs, fish, grilled cheese and much, much more. The ingenious pour spout makes transferring or pouring delicious sauces effortless. SUPERIOR PRE-SEASONED CRAFTSMENSHIP – Crafted to last for generations, Cuisinel sources the highest quality materials in casting our cookware. Cuisinel cast iron is notoriously safer than teflon or other non-stick materials. Continuous easy-to-follow seasoning will result in a safe, healthy and virtually non-stick pan. After every use, cast iron should be hand washed, dried thoroughly on the stove at medium heat and seasoned with natural oils; Do not put in dishwasher and do not air dry. INCLUDED SILICONE HANDLE HOLDERS – This world-class professional skillet set comes complete with non-slip, heat-resistant HANDLE COVERS providing a confident grip while cooking, transferring or serving food (always use oven mitt when handling cast iron cookware). Dishwasher safe and easy to hand-wash handle holders. So, while most cast iron may be awkward to handle with only an oven mitt, not only do these grips make cast iron LOOK good, they add that extra firm grip when handling hot cast iron. CARE and USE GUIDE + LIFETIME WARRANTY – Each set includes our Care and Use Guide for beginners and professional alike, so you can be confident in how to care for your new set. So, go on, fire up your Cuisinel cookware. If anything happens, it's on us. In additional to Amazon's seamless 30-day money back guarantee, Cuisinel Cast Iron guarantees the quality and durability of all its products for a lifetime, so you can be assured that you are making the right choice and there is no risk to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813NjdG4KgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"cuisinel","source_asin":"B0B89ZCZ16","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B89ZCZ16","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B89ZCZ16","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
