window.products.push({"id":557248,"name":"Monarch Specialties I COFFEE TABLE, CHROME","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":154.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gqhG-QUGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for that one piece that anchors your living room, then this stylish yet minimalist rectangular coffee table will pull it all together. This chic table is framed in a high polish silver chrome metal base with a X design on the sides for a touch of sophisticated glamour. The spacious and thick clear tempered glass top is perfect to set down a tray when entertaining, or magazines and decorative objects. With a clean and contemporary design, this coffee table looks right at home in today's living room, family room, office, or den without crowding a space. Assembly is required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gqhG-QUGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monarch Specialties","source_asin":"B07GFP1W4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GFP1W4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GFP1W4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":557249,"name":"Mandala Pumpkin 1.2\" (3cm) Diameter Wax Seal Stamp by Seasons Creations; Great for Halloween!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5134nHDMR4L._AC_.jpg","description":"1.2\" round design impression (about the size of a half dollar); Brass (color and brightness may vary).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5134nHDMR4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seasons Creations","source_asin":"B07YX8W9JB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YX8W9JB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YX8W9JB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":557250,"name":"Belle-V Kitchen's Unique Ergonomic & Crafted, Hand Polished Ice Cream Scoop, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317XKCBy+sL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Recommended Care: This item is made from stainless steel and has a mirror-like finish. To avoid dishwasher spots and for greatest durability, clean scoop with warm soapy water, rinse and dry with a soft cloth – just like you would wash your heirloom silverware. Each ice cream scoop is made from ADC12 Aluminum. We chose this material due to its combination of strength and high thermal conductivity. The heat from your hand quickly conducts down the handle to the scoop to easily release the ice cream or gelato. Each scoop begins its life by emerging from a die-cast tool. This yields a single form that is both elegant and durable. Each scoop is finished and polished by hand. No two are exactly alike, but all Belle-V scoops are made to our exacting standards. Important Note: This model is designed for left-handed users. A right-handed model is available on Amazon and our website. For concerns related to returns or warranties, please contact us via \"Contact Seller\" button found on our seller profile. From the Manufacturer $64,724 raised with 1,289 backers. Mission “La Belle Vie” is French for the good life and that is Belle-V’s mission -- to bring you more of the good life through creating kitchen utensils that you will love. What's important to Belle-V? Belle-V is passionate about creating products that are stunningly beautiful, perform brilliantly and embody craftsmanship to last and last. Stunning Beauty Each Belle-V product has a striking design you can proudly show-off when serving, hosting or entertaining. For example, the Belle-V ice cream scoop makes an excellent center piece when serving dessert at your next party. Brilliant Performance The form of each Belle-V product is driven by function and sculpted, weighted and balanced to feel just right in your hand. Incorporating functional features, such as the angled head and spade-shaped leading edge of our ice cream scoop, our products deliver exceptional performance. Crafted Heirloom Each Belle-V product is designed to last and last. Our products are born as metal castings. The simple forms are solid and durable. They are finished and polished by hand, and though no two are exactly alike, all Belle-V products are crafted to our exacting standards. Iterated and Refined Each Belle-V product is iterated and refined until it is perfected. The designs are first modeled by hand. After iterations and refinements, they are 3D printed. After further refinements, they are prototyped using the intended manufacturing process. After subsequent revisions they are released for production. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Beautiful, High-Performance, Crafted Where did you get the inspiration for your product? Dr. Karl Ulrich, Vice Dean of Innovation at the Wharton School has been collecting ice cream scoops for over twenty years. Karl noticed many scoops pose ergonomic challenges by working against the natural motion of your wrist. This makes it hard to drive through hard ice cream or easily reach into the corners of ice cream containers. Teaming up with the Belle-V team, Karl set out to create the best performing, most beautiful and durable ice cream scoop ever created. What differentiates your product from similar products out there? The drawback to many cheap products is that they don’t work well or break and are then thrown out. Belle-V products are made of stainless steel and designed to perform brilliantly and last and last. Our intention is for them to be heirloom pieces that are passed on to the next generation. Tell us about the best and most challenging parts of the creation process. We designed, tested and refined dozens of prototypes, ultimately optimizing the handle ergonomics and refining the geometry of the angled scoop head with a spade-shaped leading edge. The result: the perfect ice cream scoop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317XKCBy+sL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belle","source_asin":"B00OJQX9WW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OJQX9WW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OJQX9WW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":557251,"name":"Gangster Armor Grip for 30oz Tumblers (3 Pack) - Yeti Rambler Handle – Silicone Tumbler Sleeve Holder - RTIC Beast Simple Corkcicle Tumbler Grip Holde","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c9RWhBz0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ FITS ALL BRANDS OF TUMBLER – No matter what Tumbler you own, the silicone will snug and fit your favorite reusable cup. It is the right size to snugly fit on to your 30 Oz cup. YETI OZARK RTIC SIMPLE BEAST GANGSTER SLIM ✅ GRIP HANDLE – We spent a long time developing the right handle for you to get a good grip on your cup. It is has a 7mm thickness to make it sturdy and strong enough to hold your cup as a beer mug. The handle will be tall enough so it can still fit in most cup holders in your car, boat or RV. ✅ BOOT – The bottom silicone boot makes it Shockproof when drop your cup on any surface and absorbs impact. Notice the difference when putting on a glass table. The BOOT also makes your cup ANTISLIP which come in handy on moving vehicles or boat, so it does not slide off to the ground. ✅ PROTECTION – How often have you dropped your cup and have the bottom damaged or lid hold dented. With the Gangster Armor your cup will be always protected ✅ BUNDLE & SAVE : we offer some 2 pack and 3 pack of our Armor which will allow you to Mix and Match the BOOT & GRIP colors while saving at the same time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c9RWhBz0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gangster","source_asin":"B09QMP99S7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QMP99S7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QMP99S7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
