window.products.push({"id":557268,"name":"Honey Dew Gifts, The Best Memories Come from Bad Ideas Done with Best Friends, Kitchen Towels with Sayings, Dish Towels About Friends, Funny Tea Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lQSTjC04L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for an inexpensive yet memorable birthday gift for your best friend? If you and your best friend are kitchen divas, then this funny tea towel is spot-on. One of the hilarious kitchen towels with sayings about friendship is the Honey Dew Gifts, Best Memories Come from Bad Ideas Done with Best Friends, Kitchen Towels with Sayings, Dish Towels about Friends, Funny Tea Towel, Flour Sack Cotton Hand Towel. You can buy a few of these dish towels with sayings, so you and her will have matching dishcloths in your homes. This kitchen towel is worth your every penny. It comes in super absorbent 27 inches by 27 inches pure cotton material, giving you a quality and durable kitchen towel. Besides being absorbent dishcloths, a few of these dish towels for friends can also work as adorable wall banners and mini tapestries for your kitchen, pantry, or even in the bedroom. Buying some of these dish towels with sayings about friends will not break your savings but will surely make your best friend’s birthday happier. Each kitchen towel features a quote that resonates with your and your best friend’s strong bond. Indeed, this funny tea towel is a perfect gift for those close to your heart. You can also give one of these dish towels with sayings to your mom, sibling, classmate, or colleague whom you consider your best friend. Order yours now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lQSTjC04L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honey Dew Gifts","source_asin":"B0912KL9KR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0912KL9KR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0912KL9KR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":557269,"name":"The Company Store Holiday Ornaments Penguin Set of 3 Hand Made Multi Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51A3HAyj7qL._AC_.jpg","description":"Decked out in their colorful winter scarves, this funny family of penguins is ready to give your Christmas tree some extra fun and personality. Our Penguin , Dog , Owls Christmas tree ornaments make their home in your holiday tree with bright colors and funky polka dots. In a set of three, each Penguin ornament is wrapped in its own colorful scarf. And since the penguins are part of a family of three, each one is a slightly different size. So much more special than ordinary old Christmas tree balls, these whimsical penguins are sure to be cherished by everyone in your family. Crafted from 100% wool with poly fill, our Holiday Ornaments are soft to the touch and lightweight too, making them perfect for hanging anywhere on your tree. The loops on top make them easy to hang – just slide them onto any branch. Even if you don't decorate a Christmas tree each year, you can still fill your home with these charming little friends. Our penguin ornaments make the perfect winter-season accent on fireplace mantels, side tables, bookshelves or in other spots throughout your home. Love the look of our Penguin Family ornaments? Then be sure to look for our other Holiday Ornament sets, including a friendly group of owls and a pack of playful dogs, each sold separately. Combine all three sets to make your Christmas tree super fun and festive this holiday season. Available exclusively at The Company Store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51A3HAyj7qL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Company Store","source_asin":"B00O98XCCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O98XCCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O98XCCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
