window.products.push({"id":557309,"name":"Peugeot Paris U'Select 9-Inch Pepper & Salt Mill Set, Natural Beechwood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":123.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dK6Szsi1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The brand PEUGEOT is one of the most iconic French brands. PEUGEOT spice mills appear on the greatest chefs’ tables; the history behind them is extraordinary. In the 19th century, Peugeot began manufacturing saw blades, coffee mills, steel cage crinolines, spice mills for the dining table, penny-farthing bicycles, and more. Creativity had always steered the brand to the very pinnacle of ingenuity and innovation. Since 1850, the lion and claws on the brand’s logo have exemplify resistance, versatility and precision cutting. These symbols excellence have shaped the PEUGEOT brand for producing the strongest mechanisms on the market, with a lifetime guarantee. Today, PEUGEOT’s technology is found in spice-specific mechanisms and its unique and patented grind adjustment system, u’Select. About Peugeot Saveurs Peugeot Saveurs is located in the town Quingey near Besançon, in the French region of Doubs. With about 130 employees, the company is proud to make the world’s most celebrated spice mills. From research and development to manufacturing, the Peugeot Saveurs factory is where the wood is turned, then varnished or painted; where our exclusive spice-specific mechanisms are cut with pin-point accuracy, then assembled and fitted. Made in France, Peugeot products are exported to more than 80 countries worldwide. The Peugeot Mills Peugeot explores the territory of taste through a selection of exceptional peppers and salts. Rare, flavored, unexpected, our will is to allow you to discover the taste diversity of these spices and thus to show you how it could be used to enhance your recipes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dK6Szsi1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B07STRWCRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07STRWCRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07STRWCRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
