window.products.push({"id":557312,"name":"Molds for Resin Casting 6 Pcs Flower Shape Tray Coaster Resin Molds Kit,Casting for Making Resin Casting Molds, Coasters,Cups Mats,DIY Crafts Home Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z-8AwlCXL._AC_SL1460_.jpg","description":"Tips For Making How to Make? 1. Pour resin into measurement cup, slowly stir to release bubbles. Adding glitter or pigment into it if you need. 2. Place your favorite night light in the mold, pour in resin, allow to stand for 24 hours and take it out. How to Reduce Bubbles? Before using the resin, invert it to prevent bubbles from escaping during extrusion. Use a toothpick to concentrate the bubbles on the resin surface, and then pierce them one by one with a needle, or heat them with a hot air gun or lighter to dissipate them. How to Demold? There are two ways to make demolding easier: 1. Use some mold release to separate the resin from the mold, it will extend the service time of the mold. 2. After the finished product is completely cured, pour some soapy water into the mold to help demoulding. How to Clean and Save the Mold: 1. Prepare warm soapy water or rubbing alcohol, then wipe clean with a soft cloth. Cleaning the mold after each use can maintain the gloss of the mold and extend the service time. 2. Please store your resin molds in room temperature place,avoid from the direct sunlight.The maximum temperature of the molds can withstand is 220 Degree C (428 Degree F ). Tips: Please don't use a heat gun or torch to cure the resin, it will damage the molds. Should you have any query about the coaster casting mold, please feel free to contact us, we are always here to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z-8AwlCXL._AC_SL1460_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nothers","source_asin":"B091GJWQH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091GJWQH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091GJWQH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
