window.products.push({"id":557365,"name":"Hajoyful Squeeze Bottle Condiment Squeeze Bottles Plastic ketchup Squeeze Squirt bottle For Sauce,BBQ, Dressing, Paint, Workshop, Pancake Art Dispense","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QVdSjsFgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: 100% SAFE & BPA FREE PLASTIC. Our squeeze bottles are made of high quality BPA free and HDPE plastic.These bottles can be used and re-used multiple times without compromising the quality or becoming warped. Easy to grip, these bottles give you total control of the flow rate so nothing goes to waste. OUTSTANDING CONTAINER WITH ANTI LEAK CAP – Our 12 squeeze bottles come with the mess-free lids so you won't experience leaky lids when squirting your favorite sauce or ketchup. Unlike those who give separated tip caps, we provide you with a snapped on cap attached to the lid to avoid losing. MULTI-PURPOSE & EASY TO USE – Whether you intend to use the bottles in the kitchen - oil, vinegar, sauces,ketchup,hot sauce and other condiments; in the garage – lubricants and cleaning liquids; for arts and crafts – glue and ink, or for whichever liquids you have in mind, these versatile squeeze bottles come in handy. You can see the content level in the bottle.Just squeeze the body of bottles to make liquid flow and discrete measurements. Package Contains: 12 pack of 8oz squeezable squirting bottles with extra 1 Silicone Funnel, 12 Chalk Labels, 1 Pen.Use the Bonus funnel to enhance the pouring process.Chalk labels and write the name of the sauce. No more confusion, guessing or smelling. Enjoy your life! BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: Feel free to contact us if you experience any issues with our product. We are happy to issue you a full refund in case you are less than 100% satisfied with your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QVdSjsFgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hajoyful","source_asin":"B07Y6P86SD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y6P86SD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y6P86SD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
