window.products.push({"id":557374,"name":"Ohio Stoneware Dominion Artisan Dome Bread Baking Pan with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310Tb45tLQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Make Artisan Bread Right at Home! This attractive stoneware bread baker creates the steam that's needed for crunchy, chewy crusts while bread stays moist and soft. Not only will you get a better crust and delicious results, its vintage-like design will look great in your kitchen - in use or on display! Inspired by the stoneware of yesteryear and made in our home state of Ohio. Use in your home oven. Bell shaped, blue striped cover has a wide knob on top for easier handling. Unglazed bottom pan. Microwave and oven safe up to 450 degrees F. Lead and cadmium free. Top cover: 7\" x 11-5/8\"OD. Bottom pan: 2\"H x 10-3/4\"OD. Weight: 8 lb. USA made in Ohio. For best care:Oil your pan with neutral-flavored vegetable oil or cooking spray before each use; a nice patina will develop over time. For additional prevention of sticking, sprinkle a thin layer of cornmeal or semolina into the bottom of the oiled pan.. Putting your room temperature pan into a preheated oven is fine.. Protect from extreme temperatures. Never put in freezer; don't transfer from refrigerator to hot oven, or vice versa. Let it cool before washing.. Hand wash with warm water only. Do not use soap as stoneware will absorb it.. Do not use under a broiler or on a stovetop.. No need to soak in water before use (it's neither recommended nor necessary).. Protect your kitchen table and counter from scratches. Set pan on a trivet when it's not in the oven..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310Tb45tLQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ohio Stoneware","source_asin":"B01MRHWLLA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRHWLLA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRHWLLA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
