window.products.push({"id":557720,"name":"Tonature Custom Size Blackout Blinds Silk Phantom Cell in Cell Cordless Cellular Window Blinds for Windows Shades Energy Saving Thermal Insulated Hone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SJldQZKwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ORDER CONFIRMATION】You can choose the Color and Material Type first. Then click \"Customize Now\" on the upper right to find more size choices. Order the closest size and then we will send email within 24 hours to confirm window information,if we do not get any reply in 68 hours, we will make the size without any adjustment. If you are not sure about size and color, pls contact us before you order or just order one blind to test. 【EXCELLENT SILK PHANTOM MATERIAL】 Special cell-within-a-cell craft has a stylish look at the window. Our cell in cell honeycomb shades are designed to keep your interiors comfortable throughout every season; use natural sunlight to warm rooms in the winter and block harsh sunlight in the summer, all while lowering your heating and cooling energy costs. Shades trap it between multiple layers of cells inside each other for even greater energy efficiency. The best choice for environmentalists. 【UPGRADED CORDLESS DESIGN】These are BOTTOM-UP ONLY. Smooth and quiet glide spring system provides a clean and tangle-free look and creates a safer environment for both children and pets. It will stay at whatever position you stop and can be easily raised or lowered with the touch of a finger. The aluminum valance and bottom rail is weighted and rigid so it hangs flat and prevents from wind blowing. 【How to choose a correct size to fit? Example your window meas 23\" width by 72\" length.】INSIDE MOUNT: window width is blind width, window height is blind height. Blind Width=23\"; Blind Height=72\". OUTSIDE MOUNT: Plus at least 4\" is blind width, plus at least 4\" is blind height. Blind Width=23\"+4\"; Blind Height=72\"+4\".【Pls Note】Fabric width will be 0.16\" shorter than the size of the shade. 【Shipping and Service】Dispatch in 5 working days. 5-7 working days for transportation. Each custom size shades made to order can't be sold after a return. We appreciate your precise measures & careful orders, avoiding return without quality issues. Tonature offers a 21-year warranty on all our products, during which we will repair/replace them free of charge. Please feel free to email us by Amazon message if you have any questions. 【Easy to Clean】The cellular blinds are anti-static, so there is less dust on the fabric. Use a vacuum cleaner to suck gently, and then wipe it with a paper towel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SJldQZKwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tonature","source_asin":"B0BPYGMNXH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPYGMNXH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPYGMNXH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":557721,"name":"Department56 Original Snow Village Welcoming Christmas Lit Building and Accessory, 7.09\", Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o2asTyB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When it comes to holiday decorations, bigger is not always better. Sometimes the prettiest house on the block is the one with a candle in every window. The soft glow highlighting the architecture is the perfect complement to a starlight winter night. About Department 56: Over thirty years ago, Department 56 began as part of Bachman's, a premiere retail florist in Minneapolis. Bachman's used a numbering system to identify each of its departments. The number assigned to wholesale gift imports division was, you guessed it, 56. Now headquartered in Eden Prairie, Minnesota, Department 56 has become a leader in the giftware, collectibles and holiday decorating industry and is best known for our hand-crafted lighted villages, Snowbabies figurines and extensive lines of holiday and home decorative products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o2asTyB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department56","source_asin":"B07C4JRZSJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C4JRZSJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C4JRZSJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
