window.products.push({"id":557794,"name":"ENMOLOVE Dream Catchers,Dream Catcher Feather Native Home Wall Decoration,Macrame Wall Hanging Dreamcatcher,Bohemian Home Decor,Native American Decor ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81og9FXBayL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: The dream catcher consists of metal rings, and the woven tassel is made of 100% cotton rope, which is handcrafted by workers. Dream Catchers Size Details: Diameter 25cm/10\", Overall Length 97cm/38\" (from top to end of longest fringe). Note: One piece per pack. You can wrap your own LED string lights, which will make the Macrame wall decor gorgeous at night. Nursery Decor Dreamcatcher: Hang a dream catcher above or around your sleeping area to trap beautiful dreams in the net, then slide the feather tassels down to the sleeping person for a good night's sleep. It brings love, light and positive energy. Great for nursery wall decor. Macrame Wall Decor: The large Macrame Dream Catcher is great for home decor, boho weddings, bridal showers, engagement parties, baby showers, living rooms, kids bedrooms, balconies, party decor wall hangings. Thoughtful Gift: This natural cotton dream catcher is designed with metal rings, wooden beads, and woven tassel, which is elegant and charming, and is an eye-catching work of art. It will be a beautiful and practical gift for family or friends, also perfect for housewarming, birthdays, weddings, Christmas, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Children's Day, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81og9FXBayL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENMOLOVE","source_asin":"B09TP2D9P6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TP2D9P6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TP2D9P6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":557795,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Circle of Kindness Merriweather Cottage 20-Ounce Teapot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414mYFilxHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Inspired by the book of the same name by Jana Kolpen and Mary Tiegreen, Circle of Kindness brings the gently and welcoming spirit of the Irish countryside to your table. Based on the Aesop's quote, \"No act of kindness, however small, is ever wasted\", the book plays out the humanitarian premise that one good deed begets another to create a \"circle of kindness\". Each piece of this collection expresses the magic of the simple, giving way of life. In a creative design inspired by the book, \"Circle of Kindness\", we have brought the Merriweather cottage to your table. Enjoy your tea at a leisurely pace, knowing with this heat retaining teapot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414mYFilxHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B000NTDNEI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000NTDNEI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000NTDNEI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
