window.products.push({"id":557916,"name":"Sisoso Coffee Club Wall Decor Restaurant 1958 Edsel Old Car Tin Sign Vintage Metal Bar Poster Pub Garage Dorm Home 8x12 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71klv08kFOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let’s face it, very few people can resist the lure of nostalgia. Yet of all the eras, the 1950s seem to remain the hearts of us all because they changed the entire world in ways that are still revered to this very day. Just like any special moment in time, we all love to recall it, and nothing quite captures that time in history like an automotive tin sign. Any area or location can become a virtual conversation piece when transforming into a time capsule fashioned by nothing more than one or several of these decorative pieces. Regardless of what other furniture is in place, an automotive tin sign will instantly apprehend the imagination by magically taking anyone back to the days of California dreaming. Imagine a room in your home with your basic layout of bar stools, solid color furniture, and your simple dining room table. This wall décor is a must-have for any home that is missing that one piece that you can’t quite place your finger on but know it is needed to fill a void.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71klv08kFOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sisoso","source_asin":"B08NPDY92V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-557916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NPDY92V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NPDY92V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
